        <p><strong>16.1 Time is of the Essence.</strong> All deadlines are strict and material terms.</p>

        <p><strong>16.2 Independent Contractors.</strong> The parties are independent contractors, not partners, agents, or employees.</p>

        <p><strong>16.3 Severability.</strong> If any provision is invalid, court requested to modify to be enforceable, or sever while maintaining remaining provisions.</p>

